      "text": "def to_3(N):\n    s = \"\"\n    while N > 0:\n        s += str(N % 3)\n        N //= 3\n    return s[::-1]",
      "originalText": "def to_3(N):\n    s = \"\"\n    while N > 0:\n        s += str(N % 3)\n        N //= 3\n    return s[::-1]",
