      "text": "a = []\nfor N in range (1, 1000):\n    b = bin(N)[2:]\n    if N % 2 == 0:\n        R = \"11\" + b + \"11\"\n    else:\n        R = \"1\" + b + \"00\"\n    R = int(R,2)\n    if R > 95:\n        a.append(R)\nprint(min(a))\n\nprint(sorted(a)[:5])",
